    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "I have this exact same issue when trying to run https://github.com/google/mipnerf.\r\nI get a failed to determine best cudnn convolution algorithm when running jax.scipy.signal.convolve2d. I only get the error when running their code base and not when trying to run the convolve operation itself. It seems related to running vmap on convolve2d and is related to the version of cuda + cudnn being used.\r\n\r\ncuda 11.5 cudnn 8.3.2 jax 0.3.2",
