    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "Turns out it was an OOM error, just a bad error message. Solution is in #8506. use the environment flag ```XLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_MEM_FRACTION=0.87```. It appears that there is some kind of issue with how jax.scipy.signal.convolve2d handles preallocated memory.\r\nI believe it would be nice to have a better error message for this.",
